   "line": [
    "Nc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight to c3 — the jumping-off point for the Grand Prix, but also a tricky move order: White can develop the other knight and transpose to an Open Sicilian with d4."
  },
  {
   "ply": 4,
   "t": 59.5,
