   "line": [
    "a6"
   ],
   "spoken": "How you meet the knight to c3 depends on your Sicilian. The long-time favourite here is the early a6 — underrated, and a fine way to combat the Grand Prix and the Closed Sicilian."
  },
  {
   "ply": 5,
   "t": 70,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/1p1ppppp/p7/2p5/4P3/2N3P1/PPPP1P1P/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 0 3",
