   "line": [
    "b5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The point: an early b5, expanding on the queenside quickly."
  },
  {
   "ply": 7,
   "t": 84,
   "fen": "rnbqkbnr/3ppppp/p7/1pp5/4P3/P1N3P1/1PPP1P1P/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 0 4",
